'''March to Death (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[Dead by Encore]]. When clearing this [[No Continues]] stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Curling Cat]], Green Shell Cat.

