'''Battle:''' Immediately start spawning a couple of meatshields, Catasaurus and Catyphoon to kill the Metal One Horns as fast as you can. After they die, upgrade your Worker Cat if not running Rich Cat while holding off the Metal Doges. Make sure to consistently deploy Shigong and time Boulder Cat to reach the frontline right after Daboo attacks, helping conserve ground. This is important for the Super Metal Hippoe wave. Here, do NOT spawn Catyphoon, as they will be a waste of cash and can knock back Super Metal Hippoe just before Soba or Corrupted Moneko land their much bigger Critical Hits. Try your best to time your units, especially Soba whose damage output is crucial here, and hope for the best. Holy Blast can be used to interrupt Daboo's foreswing. If you've fended off the Super Metal Hippoe wave well enough, the Sir Metal Seal should not be an issue. Once that's taken care of, you can claim victory.

